            "sid": "AMO 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nahoshi nindi, Hanyiloŋa yaGaza yisatu, niyiwana yikwikala, hinakalekesha kubabesha kwawuku; muloŋa anatwali muza wamukuma muwukoli, kulonda ayihani kudi aEdomi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi ami nakatemesha kesi hampwembu yaGaza, kakalasha matalawu awanta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu ashakama kuAshidodi nakayifumishahu, niyena wakwata nkunyi yawanta nakamufumisha kuAshekeloni; nakabalumuna chikasa chami chakalwi nawaEkeroni; niaFwilistinu anashaluku akajilumuka. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Mwanta Nzambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
