              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nahoshi nindi, Hanyiloŋa yaTira yisatu, niyiwana yikwikala, hinakalekesha kubabesha kwawuku; muloŋa wena aheni muza wamukuma kudi aEdomi ayi muwukoli, hiyaanukili chitiyaŋenu chawubwambuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
