              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nahoshi nindi, Hanyiloŋa yaEdomi yisatu, niyiwana yikwikala, hinakalekesha kubabesha kwawuku; muloŋa yena wahaŋili mana kwindi nampoku yakabali, wakambili muchima, kuzuwa kwindi kwadiŋi nakutabola mafuku ejima, wamulaminini mana kwindi ndombu yahaya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.11",
